OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 29, jailed for raping two
OL,4,A14-year-old girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for 14 years for
OL,7,Fraping two teenage girls after
OL,8,Fencouraging them to drink alcohol at
OL,9,Fhis flat.
OL,11,FSultani Bakatash, 29, an Afghan, met
OL,12,Fone of the girls on Snapchat before
OL,13,Finviting her and her friend to his home
OL,14,Fin Georgina Court, Bolton, Greater
OL,15,FManchester, on 6 December.
OL,17,FBolton Crown Court heard the
OL,18,F14-year-old girls drank vodka and Coke
OL,19,Fand became so intoxicated they were
OL,20,Fpassing in and out of consciousness
OL,21,Fbefore Bakatash raped and sexually
OL,22,Fassaulted them.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
