OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 29, jailed for raping two
OL,4,A14-year-old girls
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing a four-week trial, he was
OL,7,Fconvicted of two counts of rape, one of
OL,8,Fsexual assault and one of assault by
OL,9,Fpenetration. The judge said his work
OL,10,Fwith the British Army in Afghanistan
OL,11,Fmight mean he was not deported.
